This software integrates and extends components from AlphaFold 2
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold), developed by Google DeepMind:
- AlphaFold 2 source code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
- AlphaFold 2 model parameters are licensed under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

CancerFold adds original JAX-native stochastic differential equation (SDE)
sampling, SE(3)-invariant history-repulsive and stereochemical biasing
potentials, somatic mutation analysis, and ensemble thermodynamics modules.
